{"fps": 30, "frames": 1533, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 122, "text": "Scientists once thought one marshmallow could predict a child's future.", "words": [{"w": "Scientists", "f": 8, "e": 23}, {"w": "once", "f": 24, "e": 31}, {"w": "thought", "f": 31, "e": 43}, {"w": "one", "f": 43, "e": 49}, {"w": "marshmallow", "f": 49, "e": 67}, {"w": "could", "f": 67, "e": 76}, {"w": "predict", "f": 76, "e": 88}, {"w": "a", "f": 88, "e": 91}, {"w": "child's", "f": 91, "e": 103}, {"w": "future.", "f": 103, "e": 115}]}, {"a": 122, "b": 212, "text": "Here's the test. A kid sits alone with one marshmallow.", "words": [{"w": "Here's", "f": 124, "e": 134}, {"w": "the", "f": 134, "e": 140}, {"w": "test.", "f": 140, "e": 149}, {"w": "A", "f": 149, "e": 152}, {"w": "kid", "f": 152, "e": 158}, {"w": "sits", "f": 158, "e": 165}, {"w": "alone", "f": 166, "e": 174}, {"w": "with", "f": 175, "e": 182}, {"w": "one", "f": 182, "e": 188}, {"w": "marshmallow.", "f": 188, "e": 207}]}, {"a": 212, "b": 283, "text": "Eat it now, or wait fifteen minutes and get two.", "words": [{"w": "Eat", "f": 214, "e": 218}, {"w": "it", "f": 219, "e": 222}, {"w": "now,", "f": 223, "e": 229}, {"w": "or", "f": 230, "e": 233}, {"w": "wait", "f": 234, "e": 240}, {"w": "fifteen", "f": 240, "e": 251}, {"w": "minutes", "f": 251, "e": 261}, {"w": "and", "f": 262, "e": 267}, {"w": "get", "f": 267, "e": 272}, {"w": "two.", "f": 273, "e": 279}]}, {"a": 283, "b": 391, "text": "Imagine you're four. The clock ticks. That marshmallow is staring at you.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 285, "e": 296}, {"w": "you're", "f": 296, "e": 305}, {"w": "four.", "f": 306, "e": 313}, {"w": "The", "f": 314, "e": 319}, {"w": "clock", "f": 320, "e": 327}, {"w": "ticks.", "f": 328, "e": 337}, {"w": "That", "f": 338, "e": 344}, {"w": "marshmallow", "f": 344, "e": 360}, {"w": "is", "f": 361, "e": 365}, {"w": "staring", "f": 365, "e": 376}, {"w": "at", "f": 376, "e": 380}, {"w": "you.", "f": 380, "e": 387}]}, {"a": 391, "b": 475, "text": "Some kids cover their eyes. Some sing. Some just stare.", "words": [{"w": "Some", "f": 393, "e": 399}, {"w": "kids", "f": 400, "e": 406}, {"w": "cover", "f": 407, "e": 415}, {"w": "their", "f": 415, "e": 423}, {"w": "eyes.", "f": 424, "e": 431}, {"w": "Some", "f": 432, "e": 438}, {"w": "sing.", "f": 439, "e": 447}, {"w": "Some", "f": 447, "e": 454}, {"w": "just", "f": 454, "e": 461}, {"w": "stare.", "f": 461, "e": 470}]}, {"a": 475, "b": 568, "text": "Years later, the kids who waited seemed to do better at school.", "words": [{"w": "Years", "f": 477, "e": 484}, {"w": "later,", "f": 485, "e": 494}, {"w": "the", "f": 494, "e": 499}, {"w": "kids", "f": 500, "e": 506}, {"w": "who", "f": 507, "e": 512}, {"w": "waited", "f": 512, "e": 521}, {"w": "seemed", "f": 522, "e": 531}, {"w": "to", "f": 531, "e": 535}, {"w": "do", "f": 536, "e": 539}, {"w": "better", "f": 540, "e": 549}, {"w": "at", "f": 549, "e": 553}, {"w": "school.", "f": 553, "e": 564}]}, {"a": 568, "b": 722, "text": "So it was all willpower, right? Then, in two thousand twelve, researchers changed one thing.", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 570, "e": 574}, {"w": "it", "f": 575, "e": 579}, {"w": "was", "f": 580, "e": 585}, {"w": "all", "f": 586, "e": 592}, {"w": "willpower,", "f": 592, "e": 609}, {"w": "right?", "f": 610, "e": 620}, {"w": "Then,", "f": 621, "e": 630}, {"w": "in", "f": 630, "e": 635}, {"w": "two", "f": 635, "e": 641}, {"w": "thousand", "f": 642, "e": 655}, {"w": "twelve,", "f": 656, "e": 668}, {"w": "researchers", "f": 669, "e": 687}, {"w": "changed", "f": 688, "e": 700}, {"w": "one", "f": 700, "e": 706}, {"w": "thing.", "f": 707, "e": 717}]}, {"a": 722, "b": 830, "text": "Before the test, an adult promised the kids fancy art supplies.", "words": [{"w": "Before", "f": 724, "e": 734}, {"w": "the", "f": 735, "e": 741}, {"w": "test,", "f": 741, "e": 750}, {"w": "an", "f": 751, "e": 755}, {"w": "adult", "f": 756, "e": 765}, {"w": "promised", "f": 765, "e": 779}, {"w": "the", "f": 780, "e": 786}, {"w": "kids", "f": 786, "e": 794}, {"w": "fancy", "f": 794, "e": 803}, {"w": "art", "f": 804, "e": 810}, {"w": "supplies.", "f": 811, "e": 826}]}, {"a": 830, "b": 889, "text": "For half the kids, she came back with them.", "words": [{"w": "For", "f": 832, "e": 837}, {"w": "half", "f": 837, "e": 843}, {"w": "the", "f": 843, "e": 847}, {"w": "kids,", "f": 848, "e": 855}, {"w": "she", "f": 855, "e": 860}, {"w": "came", "f": 860, "e": 866}, {"w": "back", "f": 866, "e": 872}, {"w": "with", "f": 872, "e": 878}, {"w": "them.", "f": 878, "e": 885}]}, {"a": 889, "b": 979, "text": "For the other half, she came back empty-handed and said sorry.", "words": [{"w": "For", "f": 891, "e": 896}, {"w": "the", "f": 897, "e": 901}, {"w": "other", "f": 902, "e": 909}, {"w": "half,", "f": 910, "e": 917}, {"w": "she", "f": 918, "e": 923}, {"w": "came", "f": 923, "e": 929}, {"w": "back", "f": 930, "e": 936}, {"w": "empty-handed", "f": 936, "e": 953}, {"w": "and", "f": 954, "e": 958}, {"w": "said", "f": 959, "e": 965}, {"w": "sorry.", "f": 966, "e": 974}]}, {"a": 979, "b": 1019, "text": "Then came the marshmallow.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "f": 981, "e": 986}, {"w": "came", "f": 987, "e": 993}, {"w": "the", "f": 993, "e": 998}, {"w": "marshmallow.", "f": 998, "e": 1014}]}, {"a": 1019, "b": 1097, "text": "Kids who'd been let down waited about three minutes.", "words": [{"w": "Kids", "f": 1021, "e": 1027}, {"w": "who'd", "f": 1028, "e": 1035}, {"w": "been", "f": 1036, "e": 1042}, {"w": "let", "f": 1043, "e": 1048}, {"w": "down", "f": 1048, "e": 1054}, {"w": "waited", "f": 1055, "e": 1064}, {"w": "about", "f": 1065, "e": 1072}, {"w": "three", "f": 1073, "e": 1081}, {"w": "minutes.", "f": 1081, "e": 1093}]}, {"a": 1097, "b": 1179, "text": "Kids who'd seen a kept promise waited about twelve.", "words": [{"w": "Kids", "f": 1099, "e": 1106}, {"w": "who'd", "f": 1106, "e": 1114}, {"w": "seen", "f": 1114, "e": 1121}, {"w": "a", "f": 1121, "e": 1124}, {"w": "kept", "f": 1124, "e": 1130}, {"w": "promise", "f": 1131, "e": 1142}, {"w": "waited", "f": 1142, "e": 1151}, {"w": "about", "f": 1152, "e": 1160}, {"w": "twelve.", "f": 1160, "e": 1171}]}, {"a": 1179, "b": 1277, "text": "Same test. Same marshmallow. Four times the patience.", "words": [{"w": "Same", "f": 1181, "e": 1188}, {"w": "test.", "f": 1189, "e": 1198}, {"w": "Same", "f": 1199, "e": 1206}, {"w": "marshmallow.", "f": 1207, "e": 1227}, {"w": "Four", "f": 1227, "e": 1235}, {"w": "times", "f": 1235, "e": 1245}, {"w": "the", "f": 1245, "e": 1251}, {"w": "patience.", "f": 1252, "e": 1267}]}, {"a": 1277, "b": 1335, "text": "You see, waiting isn't just willpower.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 1279, "e": 1284}, {"w": "see,", "f": 1284, "e": 1291}, {"w": "waiting", "f": 1291, "e": 1301}, {"w": "isn't", "f": 1302, "e": 1309}, {"w": "just", "f": 1310, "e": 1316}, {"w": "willpower.", "f": 1317, "e": 1331}]}, {"a": 1335, "b": 1431, "text": "It's whether you believe the second marshmallow is really coming.", "words": [{"w": "It's", "f": 1337, "e": 1343}, {"w": "whether", "f": 1344, "e": 1354}, {"w": "you", "f": 1355, "e": 1360}, {"w": "believe", "f": 1360, "e": 1371}, {"w": "the", "f": 1371, "e": 1376}, {"w": "second", "f": 1377, "e": 1386}, {"w": "marshmallow", "f": 1386, "e": 1402}, {"w": "is", "f": 1403, "e": 1406}, {"w": "really", "f": 1407, "e": 1416}, {"w": "coming.", "f": 1417, "e": 1427}]}, {"a": 1431, "b": 1533, "text": "And nobody waits for a promise they don't believe.", "words": [{"w": "And", "f": 1433, "e": 1438}, {"w": "nobody", "f": 1439, "e": 1448}, {"w": "waits", "f": 1448, "e": 1456}, {"w": "for", "f": 1456, "e": 1461}, {"w": "a", "f": 1462, "e": 1464}, {"w": "promise", "f": 1465, "e": 1475}, {"w": "they", "f": 1476, "e": 1482}, {"w": "don't", "f": 1482, "e": 1490}, {"w": "believe.", "f": 1491, "e": 1502}]}]}